  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/143",
  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;\">'말머리'에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요^^</span><br></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.</span></b></span></p></div><p><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">엽록체 관찰을 위해 검정말이 꼭 필요한가 고민하다가..</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">친정 연수조에 검정말이 있어 몇 움큼 뜯어 왔습니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">오~~</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">검정말로 하는 이유가 있군요.</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">공변세포 관찰할 때 보이던 엽록체와는 클라스가 다릅니다 ㅎ</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">일단 얇게 포(?)를 뜨느라 시간을 허비할 일이 없으니 다행.</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">그런데, 최고배율로 봐야 엽록체느낌이 파팍!</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">전부 찾아줘야 할꺼나...&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">지원자 받아 훈련시켜볼까 합니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">저배율-&gt;고배율로 사진배열.</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">최저배율은 40배인데, 나머지 둘은 대물렌즈 배율을 안 보고 올라와버림..^^</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2365915053A7D9BC2B\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"580\" width=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_1999.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2365915053A7D9BC2B2C43\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234B9B5053A7D9BD0C\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"580\" width=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_2003.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_234B9B5053A7D9BD0C993F\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2676405053A7D9BE29\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"580\" width=\"580\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"IMG_2007.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_2676405053A7D9BE295070\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 18px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; text-align: justify;\"><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
